      "standardized_narrative": "At 31 December 2019 the syndicate's gross claims outstanding opening position (1 Jan 2019) was GBP 411.463m. During 2019 there was a net prioryear deterioration (strengthening) of GBP 3.7m on prior years' provisions driven by adverse development particularly in third party liability (GBP 11.5m), energy (GBP 4.3m) and pecuniary loss (GBP 3.4m), partly offset by an improvement on reinsurance acceptances (GBP 17.5m). The movements reflect adverse claim developments and some large manmade and natural catastrophe losses from prior years (e.g. 2017 hurricanes, 2018 wildfires and Jebi) together with recoveries from reinsurance programmes.",
      "raw_causal_phrases": [
        "An overall deterioration of GBP 3.7 million on prior years' provisions was experienced during the year.",
        "Deteriorations of GBP 11.5 million on third party liability, GBP 4.3 million on energy and GBP 3.4 million on pecuniary loss were largely offset by an improvement of GBP 17.5 million on reinsurance acceptances.",
        "The 2017 year also required a strengthening of the reserves within the casualty account, in line with the market, following increased medium sized losses from the California wildfires and the MGM shooting in the US."
